(single-aero)
*title Aerodynamic force aggregation equivalence
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=10000 long=0 lat=0 vel=1000 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=20
  *file aero-aggregation.dat time alt vel xecfc yecfc zecfc ca cn
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *aero ca=0.20 cn=0 sref=10
    *fly alpha=0
    *fly betae=0
    *fly bankgd=0
    *when time=3 stop
*end
